{
  "_comment": "Cases for the soft-navigation router's pure rules (app/static/js/router.js): which link clicks it takes (spec 5.1) and what it does with a fetched page (spec 5.2 steps 2-3, 5.5). Run by app/tests/js/router.mjs. attrs defaults: no target, no download, no data-ws-hard, primary button, no modifier keys.",
